OL,3,GNEWSAEx-chief minister calls for MSG
OL,4,Acontract rethink
OL,5,
OL,6,FGuernsey's former chief minister is
OL,7,Fcalling for a change to the contract
OL,8,Fwith the provider of secondary
OL,9,Fhealthcare.
OL,11,FFollowing Health and Social Care
OL,12,FCommittee's (HSC) annual report saying
OL,13,Fthe Medical Specialist Group (MSG) had
OL,14,Fmissed 15 of its 22 main targets in
OL,15,F2025, Deputy Gavin St Pier said "a more
OL,16,Ffundamental change in the States'
OL,17,Fcommissioning model" was needed.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,443,440,260,160,0,100
