OL,3,GNEWSAEx-chief minister calls for MSG
OL,4,Acontract rethink
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe added: "The report rightly seeks to
OL,7,Fexplain why last year's numbers are
OL,8,Fwhat they are but... it noticeably does
OL,9,Fnot seek to explain what is being done
OL,10,Fto improve the position."
OL,12,FDr Michelle Le Cheminant, chair of the
OL,13,FMSG, said: "Patient outcomes and the
OL,14,Fexperience people have of their care
OL,15,Fare at the heart of everything we do."
